    <section className="team-statement section-pad"><div className="container team-statement-inner"><span className="team-sun" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><Eyebrow>How we show up</Eyebrow><h2>Curious enough to ask.<br /><span>Thoughtful enough to listen.</span></h2><p>We believe different perspectives make the work stronger. We work transparently, share what we learn, and make it easier for everyone to contribute their best.</p></div></div></section>
